Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.24,0:00:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's quite the traumatic experience\Nbeing eaten alive by your own sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.42,0:00:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then again,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.48,0:00:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when a man uncovers his deepest desires,\Nall of his weaknesses are laid bare.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.38,0:00:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gave Nary a thought\Nto the depraved nature of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.08,0:00:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bringing someone back to\Nthe world of the living.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone desperately wants to believe that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.28,0:00:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their loved ones are\Nstill alive somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.24,0:00:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More than anything else,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.98,0:00:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your hope is that by some miracle\Nthey'll suddenly pop in tomorrow and say,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.32,0:00:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.30,0:00:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, before I forget, I believe you\Nsaid something about a third wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.16,0:00:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if I'm not mistaken,\Nyou've already made said wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.58,0:00:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.78,0:00:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wish for Avdol to come back to life!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.26,0:00:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hail to you!
