Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.94,0:01:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.46,0:01:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a star-dust It's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.22,0:01:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,called 100 years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.30,0:01:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The young men are facing The time
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.22,0:02:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is time for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.22,0:03:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all it's me!
Dialogue: 2,0:03:04.08,0:03:09.54,Title 3,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,480)\pos(197,805)}Episode 22: Judgement, Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.22,0:03:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.40,0:03:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My fingers, they've crumpled to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.52,0:03:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On your feet, Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.02,0:03:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I blame you for all of this because\Nof your idiotic, bumbling eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.78,0:03:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, because of\Nyou I ended up like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.04,0:03:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.66,0:03:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The person to blame for this is me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.24,0:03:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mark my words, you'll pay for this,\NPolnareff, and you'll do it with your flesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.52,0:03:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get better if I eat, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.20,0:03:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.88,0:03:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, big brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.58,0:04:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.56,0:04:09.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.62,0:04:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.22,0:04:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both of you, please go\Nback to your graves!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.84,0:04:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.75,0:04:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who brought\Nus back, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.86,0:04:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time has come for\Nyou to enter your grave!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.14,0:04:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so panicked that I\Nforgot to summon chariots!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.48,0:04:35.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could I have been so caught up in my\Nwish that I neglected to use my stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.22,0:04:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.13,0:04:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.58,0:04:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, just stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.94,0:04:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the? Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.98,0:04:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.30,0:04:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have any wishes left, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.48,0:04:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already granted your three wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.12,0:05:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm sorry to say,\Nyou don't get any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.98,0:05:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.92,0:05:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hail to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.78,0:05:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, writhe and scream to\Nyour pathetic heart's content.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.14,0:05:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you're in the middle of nowhere,\Nyour friends by the shore won't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.34,0:05:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one can save you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.20,0:05:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.52,0:05:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.92,0:05:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.86,0:05:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.90,0:05:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sherry... Avdol...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.92,0:05:50.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose you're giving\Nme what I deserved.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.92,0:05:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only fitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.36,0:05:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.82,0:05:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You died because of my actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.14,0:06:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so, I've accepted my fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.30,0:06:13.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.26,0:06:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My vision must be going.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.38,0:06:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm seeing double.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.38,0:06:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like there are two Avdals.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.60,0:06:25.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.20,0:06:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course there's not another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.34,0:06:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm starting to see things,\Nguess it means the end is near.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.62,0:06:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blood loss is taking its toll.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.48,0:06:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm hallucinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.76,0:06:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.38,0:06:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.02,0:06:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have to tap out early.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.36,0:06:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Mr. Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.46,0:06:49.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.74,0:06:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.88,0:06:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I pray for your victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.38,0:06:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for you, Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.28,0:06:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll atone in the next world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.60,0:07:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.80,0:07:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.16,0:07:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just knew I saw another Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.22,0:07:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My eyes weren't playing tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.18,0:07:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides the dirt and dust version\Ncameo made, there's another Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.42,0:07:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magicians run!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.78,0:07:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.06,0:07:36.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's supposed to be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.68,0:07:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.74,0:07:40.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was stabbed by the\Nhangman's centerfold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.74,0:07:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the hell is he alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.16,0:07:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you really Mohammed Avdol?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.44,0:07:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, you have better believe I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.30,0:07:59.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.28,0:08:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, you?
