Dialogue: 2,0:08:10.05,0:08:10.09,SFXPink,3,0,0,0,,{=12}{\bord0\blur0.6\pos(1881.25,25.27)\fade(255,0,255,-4590,-4090,60,60)\4a&HFF&\frz356.4}Rumble
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.08,0:08:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still lose all common\Nsense when it comes to your
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.84,0:08:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sister and never stop to\Nthink of the consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.36,0:08:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I simply refuse to accept this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.96,0:08:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Muhammad Avdol is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.30,0:08:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was told whole horse put a\Nbullet between your eyes after
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.50,0:08:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hangman sunk his blade into your\Nback and you died on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.18,0:08:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're correct about me being\Nshot right in the forehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.74,0:08:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said because I was stabbed\Nin the back for a moment
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.36,0:08:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my face was looking up and\Nthe bullet only grazed me I.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.84,0:08:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suppose this is what one would\Ncall a blessing in disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.96,0:08:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holehorse didn't realize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.16,0:08:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But his bullet never made\Ncontact with my brain,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.48,0:08:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so he didn't inflict a mortal wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.88,0:08:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was only able to scratch\Nmy skin and bruise my skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.76,0:09:01.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although I did completely\Nlose consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.54,0:09:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you call yourself Cameo\Nof the Judgment card.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.82,0:09:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hell is near.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.14,0:09:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So prepare.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.86,0:09:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For hell to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.14,0:09:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it was only the third\Nwish, but still, it's really him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.50,0:09:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It came true.
