Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.60,0:09:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Muhammad Avdol is indeed alive and well.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:36.84,0:09:38.01,Eyecatch2 - Base,signbot,0,0,0,,{\blur13\alpha&H80&\3c&HFDFDFD&\pos(1621,788)}Cameo
Dialogue: 2,0:09:36.84,0:09:38.01,Eyecatch2 - Base,signbot,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\c&H4B4646&\pos(1621,788)}Cameo
Dialogue: 3,0:09:36.84,0:09:38.01,Eyecatch2 - Base,signbot,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.6\shad2\4a&HFF&\pos(1621,788)}Cameo
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.78,0:09:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would call this bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.66,0:09:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That being the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.36,0:09:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shouldn't you scurry away\Nto inform Dio and your
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.72,0:09:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fellow stand-user\Ncompatriots about my return?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.02,0:09:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, shouldn't you, Cameo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.28,0:09:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.32,0:09:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to tell them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.88,0:09:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to let Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.94,0:10:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, Kakyoin, and\NJotaro know! Avdol's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.98,0:10:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is very surprising news to be sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.96,0:10:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the way I see it,\NI can spin it this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.68,0:10:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only did Judgment's cameo\Nslay the idiot Balnareff?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.58,0:10:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but also succeeded in eliminating Avdol?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.44,0:10:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who was actually alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.38,0:10:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can't wait to tell\Nthem the splendid news!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.06,0:10:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maticians, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.54,0:10:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.96,0:10:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.50,0:10:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This stand, it's four more\Npowerful than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.52,0:10:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful, it's not just his power!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.20,0:10:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's got incredible speed too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.44,0:10:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come now, Avdol, is that the\Nextent of your abilities?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.68,0:10:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If so, then sharing my good news\Nwill be even easier than expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.62,0:10:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May Fortune
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.68,0:11:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be with you both?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.58,0:11:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.46,0:11:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hail to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.26,0:11:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.60,0:11:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, stop this charade.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.32,0:11:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not the real Sherry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.92,0:11:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Sherry is gone. Dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.14,0:11:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a hunk of dirt!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.22,0:11:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, brother…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.18,0:11:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.70,0:11:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would like to take back what\NI said about you not changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.04,0:11:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you were right about me all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.16,0:11:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who should apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.34,0:12:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This battle has already been decided!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.72,0:12:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell you what!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.82,0:12:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, before you head off\Nfor that magic lamp in the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.44,0:12:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to hear your three wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.96,0:12:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll grant them before I\Nput you to rest for good
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.88,0:12:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.18,0:12:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may as well give it a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.14,0:12:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I said, you get three wishes Kel salut.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.38,0:12:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's making fools of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.00,0:12:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just ignore him, Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.60,0:12:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to make any wishes
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.86,0:12:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol, are you listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.82,0:12:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No good
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.02,0:12:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want four wishes. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.16,0:12:51.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.34,0:12:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.68,0:12:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.78,0:12:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm asking you to grant my wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.72,0:12:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only I want four instead of three.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.16,0:13:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol, you can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.92,0:13:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you denying my wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.80,0:13:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cameo, you're the one who\Noffered to grant them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.72,0:13:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make sure\Nyou keep your promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.02,0:13:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still insist upon this\Nfutile contest of power?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.88,0:13:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your kicks are nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.36,0:13:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.76,0:13:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the way! Super!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.18,0:13:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should probably know that my first\Nwish was to make you cry out in agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.36,0:13:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it came true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.34,0:13:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.84,0:13:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you be so much\Nstronger than before?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.12,0:13:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wound left behind\Nafter I was stabbed by
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.48,0:13:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Hanged Man hasn't\Ncompletely healed yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.62,0:13:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I was so focused on\Nguarding my wound from an assault,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.94,0:13:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to hold myself back a little. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.02,0:14:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was only three days ago that I\Nwas finally able to stand again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.00,0:14:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But since I took a plane here from\NIndia, the trip was very easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.64,0:14:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.72,0:14:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.36,0:14:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, for my second wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.92,0:14:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish for you to scream\Nout in utter terror.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.98,0:14:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And while you're at it,\Ngrant my third wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.54,0:14:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cry and regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.30,0:14:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fat bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.74,0:14:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's running away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.14,0:14:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.24,0:14:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.46,0:14:36.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.37,0:14:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.52,0:14:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With that kind of power\Nand speed given the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.44,0:14:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rule of stands the user\Nmust be hiding somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.96,0:14:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nearby supplying his
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.24,0:14:48.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stand with
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.15,0:14:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,energy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.07,0:14:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is he
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.80,0:14:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here yes he should be\Nhiding out very close to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.06,0:15:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, could that be...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.20,0:15:11.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.30,0:15:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.96,0:15:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has this user really resorted\Nto hiding underground?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.52,0:15:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn coward, how dare you use my\Nsister like some pawn in a game!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.68,0:15:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For what you've done, I\Nthink I'll show you hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.74,0:15:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hell to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.96,0:15:47.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Corner!
