Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.58,0:15:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like dirt and sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.88,0:15:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A spider,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.04,0:16:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ants too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.24,0:16:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and a match.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.72,0:16:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard, I hope you're ready because\Nyour suffering has barely begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.08,0:16:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Polnareff,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.14,0:16:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do believe it's time\Nfor me to drain the snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.82,0:16:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about it, my friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.88,0:16:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall we engage in the timeless\Nritual of male bonding? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.50,0:16:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow I made it out of that mess alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.42,0:16:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.10,0:16:45.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Boulder F, let me hear you laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.36,0:16:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to hear the hardiest\Nlaugh that you can muster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.78,0:16:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol, I might be wrong about this, but it\Nseems like you're the one who's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.06,0:16:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before the incident,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.98,0:17:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you would have never thought of\Ndoing something quite so perverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.08,0:17:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.99,0:17:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this isn't a result of you\Nbeing shot in the head, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.60,0:17:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it! Aim that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.76,0:17:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.88,0:17:21.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.79,0:17:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.84,0:17:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, I beg you, forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.62,0:17:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last but not least, my fourth wish
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.22,0:17:35.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is to not grant you a single\None of your pitiful wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.08,0:17:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Magician's Red forgives no one,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.98,0:17:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,especially not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.02,0:17:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.36,0:17:47.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Badumps!
