Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.38,0:18:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, we were worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.26,0:18:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did those injuries come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.18,0:18:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some kind of enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.82,0:18:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My wounds are nothing compared to my news!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.12,0:18:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now listen up and don't\Nbe too shocked, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.94,0:18:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're gonna have to promise you\Nwon't throw your back out and surprise,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.14,0:18:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.05,0:18:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do you think I met out there, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.82,0:18:17.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.26,0:18:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now prepare to be blown away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.34,0:18:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tum-ta-da-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.12,0:18:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.02,0:18:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sly bastard Avdol is\Nstill alive, isn't that great?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.98,0:18:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we should probably get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.68,0:18:39.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, allow me to help\Nyou carry your luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.76,0:18:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol, how you been doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.34,0:18:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.34,0:18:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How goes it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.25,0:18:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Avdol, is the wound on\Nyour back healing up all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.10,0:18:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fine, though my joints do\Nget a little stiff sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.34,0:18:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.25,0:18:52.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has it really been two weeks\Nsince we last saw each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.80,0:18:53.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.71,0:18:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're lucky to all be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.94,0:18:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, you're still wearing your uniform?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.32,0:18:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you ever get hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.50,0:19:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, just hold on a second, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.14,0:19:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.26,0:19:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you to hold on\Na second, you assholes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.82,0:19:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the deal with those\Nlaissez-faire attitudes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.34,0:19:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A man we thought was dead\Njust waltzed onto the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.14,0:19:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the hell can you just brush it\Noff and act like nothing has changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.74,0:19:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I'm sorry about that, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.46,0:19:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I told you I'd taken it upon myself\Nto bury Avdol in India, I may have lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.46,0:19:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?! Mr.
