Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.90,0:19:35.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on my head back in India after\NI was shot by Hull Horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.08,0:19:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You assholes have known Avdol was\Nalive the entire time and never
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.90,0:19:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,once stood across any of your\Ndeceitful minds to let me know!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.00,0:19:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm most surprised at you, Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.08,0:19:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only found out the day\Nafter it all happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.34,0:19:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it was imperative to\Nnot let the enemy know,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.94,0:19:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and since you have such a big mouth,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.64,0:19:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suggested... Pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.42,0:19:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I meant to say was, since it's\Nnot easy for you to lie on command,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.54,0:19:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suggested we keep it a secret from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.98,0:20:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you'd let the secret slip, Avdol wouldn't\Nhave been able to recuperate in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.22,0:20:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were planning to let you know the\Nvery moment we knew that he was safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.74,0:20:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we didn't think\Nyou'd run into him first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.26,0:20:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.17,0:20:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol, we found your dad\Nliving in a hut on this island!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.42,0:20:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's let him know you're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.94,0:20:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that was just me in disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.40,0:20:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.58,0:20:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you were in on it\Nfrom the very start?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.16,0:20:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything that happened\Nwas a ruse you created?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.70,0:20:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't talk to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.94,0:20:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one ever comes to visit when\Nthey have good news to report!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.34,0:20:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.74,0:20:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.98,0:20:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol's death wasn't your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.80,0:20:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to go that far!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.74,0:20:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you leave me out of the loop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.74,0:20:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that's the cruelest\Nthing you've ever done to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.50,0:20:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, now, chin up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.82,0:20:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no reason for you to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.54,0:20:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.84,0:20:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I truly didn't think you'd be this hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.14,0:20:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.90,0:20:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I had a very good reason for\Ncoming to this island in disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.66,0:21:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.72,0:21:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was partially so the\Nenemy wouldn't find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.18,0:21:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I also had Abdal do some shopping\Nfor me while he was laying low.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.20,0:21:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of shopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.82,0:21:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since it was a very\Nconspicuous acquisition,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.48,0:21:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I disguised myself as a\Nwealthy Arab gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.10,0:21:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.76,0:21:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's climb aboard and head out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.74,0:21:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.16,0:21:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the love of everything\Nthat's sacred, cheer up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.08,0:21:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.99,0:21:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.91,0:21:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.82,0:21:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand what's almost here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.32,0:21:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.14,0:21:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.30,0:21:39.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.21,0:21:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A submarine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.18,0:21:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.20,0:21:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From here on out,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.12,0:21:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're riding to egypt in this you you've\Ngot to be kidding how did you afford this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.00,0:22:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all your paintings on the tomb they\Ndo the sand dance don't you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.68,0:22:15.10,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.76,0:22:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if they move too quick they're\Nfalling down like a domino
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.10,0:22:17.35,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They do the sand dance, don'tcha know?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.35,0:22:18.81,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,If they move too quick
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.44,0:22:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on the buzzer men by the\Nnile they got the money on a
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.60,0:22:22.07,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.90,0:22:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bed called crocodiles they\Nsnap their teeth on your
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.07,0:22:24.40,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the bazaar men by the Nile
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.40,0:22:26.74,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They got the money on a bet
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.08,0:22:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cigarette foreign types with
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.74,0:22:28.24,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Gold crocodiles
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.86,0:22:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a hookah walk
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.91,0:22:31.37,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They snap their teeth on your cigarette
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.30,0:22:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.37,0:22:33.58,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Foreign types with their hookah pipes say
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.14,0:22:37.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an egyptian
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.58,0:22:43.13,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.72,0:22:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the blonde waitresses take\Ntheir trays spin around and they
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.02,0:22:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cross the floor they've got\Nthe moves you drop your drink
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.51,0:22:56.98,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,The blonde waitresses take their trays
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.98,0:22:59.35,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They spin around and they cross the floor
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.20,0:23:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then they bring you more all\Nthe school kids so sick of books
