Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.65,0:23:03.98,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,You drop your drink then they bring you more
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.02,0:23:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they like the punk and the\Nmetal band when the buzzer rings
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.98,0:23:06.32,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the school kids so sick of books
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.30,0:23:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're walking like an egyptian all\Nthe kids in the marketplace say wayo,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.32,0:23:08.65,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They like the punk and the metal band
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.65,0:23:10.11,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,When the buzzer rings
