Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.26,0:23:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wayo, wayo, wayo, wayo
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.28,0:23:15.49,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the kids in the marketplace say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.98,0:23:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,walk like an egyptian
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.63,0:23:25.71,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.88,0:23:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sparkly design is\Nmuch more to my liking?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.68,0:23:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A submarine, huh?
Dialogue: 2,0:23:26.92,0:23:28.92,Next Episode,,0,0,0,,{\fs120\pos(960,730)}Next Episode {PREVIEW IS NOT UP TO DATE}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.96,0:23:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps a refreshing\Nwhite would be better?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.18,0:23:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry and make the coffee!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.54,0:23:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one should I pick?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.84,0:23:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakuwi, why'd you grab\Nsix cups? Yes, hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.20,0:23:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Joseph, darling, it's you!
